{"server":"jp","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_02_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_02","title":"歌い手","storyCode":"SV-2","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"86639b329db5f8101e38a24fe8fe43c74fb34ad66b79ae73548d8976fab28be4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ほとんど廃墟と化した都市には、奇妙な住民が住んでいた。滅多に訪れないよそ者を彼らは警戒し、冷遇し……そうして、双方が衝突し合う。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_02"},{"type":"narration","text":"p.m. 3:23 天気/曇天\nイベリア サルヴィエント"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"地図にある場所は……ここね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"……嫌な臭い。それに、気持ちいいとは言えない空気だわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"すみません――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別の男性住民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ここには怪物がいる、ですって？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人しかいないみたいだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（イベリア語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今はこんな言い方しないのかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（発音を少し変えたイベリア語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……それに、今の私は歌い手だもの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ホセさんが言ってたわ。歌い手はそんなことしないって。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今、何か言ってたわね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子供……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"間違いない……数字を数えてるみたいね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私からネックレスを盗っていくなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待ちなさい！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼い住民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九、九十九……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もう逃げられないわよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼い住民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う……あぅ～……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"なぜ私の物を盗ったの？　ここへおびき寄せるためかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そう……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"落とし穴に、縄まで仕掛けて……残念だけど見え見えよ。三流バウンティハンターの待ち伏せの方が、まだサマになってたわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出てきなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私もあなたたちに用事があるの。さっさとして。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"妙な奴だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"そうだな、トタン。こんな奴、見たことない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"俺も、見たことがない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたたち、言葉を話せたのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は何者だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"さすらいの歌い手よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"さすらいの歌い手？　それは何だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"トタン、こいつと話すな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"知らない顔だ。妙な服を着ている。よそ者だな。何をしに来た？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聞きたいことがあるの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"お前……新品の服を着ているな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私の仲間を見なかった？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、強そうだ。腹いっぱい食えているんだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼女は私より先にここへ来たはずなの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"その箱も、重そうだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……楽器なんてどれも重たいものよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"持っているものだって、おかしい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ここのハープも、これと似たようなものでしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ほら、ちょっと弾いてあげるわ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"……ッ！　耳がおかしくなりそうだ。武器に、違いない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武器以外の使い方もあるわよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"トタン、こいつ、変だ。もう構うな。話すの、疲れた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"おい。ベンチを放せ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ベンチ……この子のことかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"この子に危害を加えるつもりなんてないわ。ネックレスを持って行かれたから、追いかけたの。大事な物なのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は、何か奪いに来たのか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"違うわ。私は自分の物を取り返して、それから話の通じる相手を見つけたいと思っただけよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼い住民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あぅ……う～……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たちの子供に、触ることは許さない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たちの物を、奪うことも許さない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何を……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たちのルールを、破ることも許さない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"トタン、あまり近付くな。どうするつもりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつは俺たちの子供を傷つけ、俺たちの物を奪い、俺たちのルールを破ろうとしている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつは、俺たちの姉妹ではないのか？　姉妹には、分け与えてやるべきだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつは、違う。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……話が通じる相手じゃなさそうね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"なら、他をあたるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"駄目だ。行かせない。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"待て、トタン……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、穴が、ある……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"木枠の穴だ。忘れたのか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あら、それ本当に役に立つのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性住民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"よそ者、ここは俺たちの場所だ。お前が来ていい場所ではない！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
